  "description": "CH-on is a furry convention in Switzerland organized by the Swissfurs association. It is usually held in scenic locations in the Swiss Alps and focuses on good local cuisine and a laid-back atmosphere without much formal programming. The first convention was held June 12 to 15, 2008, at Morschach near Lake Lucerne, in a house for up to 40 participants. Editions followed each June through 2012, in Gysenstein near Bern and Achsetten in Adelboden.",
